<DemoExample Title="Style & Class" RazorCode="@example13RazorCode" Id="example13">
    <div>
        The look of the breadcrumb is customizable at three levels: the Style and Class of the component,
        the Style and Class of a single option, and the Styles and Classes of every part of it (the root, the
        items, the selected item, the dividers, the overflow button and menu, ...).
    </div>
    <br /><br />
